{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30018_01_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:36964ddeeae6664f30d04b2d7849c96f3b2837fa44bf72b5108b5b18addda033",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b22b00fad215df5d736ad0bb401c34fdda78f1bf2e1e6e959a12919855aeda6a",
      "text": "接下来是“恋爱烦恼咨询室”环节！\n这次特别由Jupiter来为大家解答！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cc0e0dcf31927fe5d4c59e8e7b2a0b4bf3b15c994fa4ed3695cecdd37b1181f",
      "text": "那么立刻进入来信介绍环节。“不知道怎么跟喜欢的\n女孩子好好搭话，很苦恼”，这位听众是这么说的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de73bbb80f31f9217395ba9b222549adb71b235180014f41e760f2098e7beab0",
      "text": "原来如此啊……唔——\n总之先从打招呼开始试试看怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34cc9f745297823bb08f457a47b828b104dd8ef033f4ac7b1ab72445338516c2",
      "text": "就算只是一句“早上好”，也是巨大的进步了吧。\n越是想着要好好说话，反而越说不出来嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:239077200afaa689ce1c934dfdaa28d30f5875263d1e576ceb903596f75da52f",
      "text": "说得对呢～被人说一句“早上好”，\n其实心里还是蛮高兴的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01aed25b08bd323e62338a42d8079315b335c029671c07155cff1d62127621a1",
      "text": "说不定以此为契机，\n意外地就能聊上天了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14ea5d0b77dcb82ccd04f4b4f2c34b436a43863a04acb50bef427b876eecd343",
      "text": "嗯，我也这么觉得。另外，如果要给建议的话……\n就是别忘了保持笑容，大概是这点吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbe88946bf425737a75452a5f73afbc5ee9acd9460a3cc2d214e19e265f5a4df",
      "text": "因为那会决定对方对你的印象呢。\n脸上常带笑容的人，很让人心动哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b202b71f4332f273eb3f9d711fc69ae3ec70949dacce8a44797bc849d4ec0558",
      "text": "哦哦～虽然广告里的表现也很好，但现实中的\nJupiter更有亲和力，真不错呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58ee46872bfee21f9cd8e7df95292e2000444eb3fee4704ca25bcf4ade414b5f",
      "text": "打招呼的话门槛也低……\n明天就立刻尝试看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
